24: - Locate the invariant layer â€” €” find `invariant/` in the project root. List every `{domain}-{constraint}.md` file. Treat the layer as the outermost fact set.
26: - Read the governing invariants â€” €” read the matching invariant files for the task domain. Extract from each:
27:   - The invariant â€” one declarative predicate sentence
